### Create a new order (Production-ready flow)
### This will:
### 1. Call ProductService gRPC to reserve stock
### 2. Create order in database
### 3. Publish OrderCreated event to RabbitMQ
POST http://localhost:5003/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shippingAddress": "123 Nguyen Hue, District 1, HCMC",
  "billingAddress": "123 Nguyen Hue, District 1, HCMC",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "product-guid-1",
      "quantity": 2,
      "unitPrice": 150000
    },
    {
      "productId": "product-guid-2",
      "quantity": 1,
      "unitPrice": 500000
    }
  ],
  "shippingCost": 30000,
  "discount": 50000
}

### Get orders by user ID
GET http://localhost:5003/api/orders/user/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get order details by order ID
GET http://localhost:5003/api/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get orders in date range (Admin only)
GET http://localhost:5003/api/orders/range?startDate=2026-01-01&endDate=2026-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
